{
 "title": "Using the Calendar by Keyboard",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Using the Calendar by Keyboard</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"You can select dates with the keyboard.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"You can select dates with the keyboard.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page task  - topic-topic task-task \" id=\"loio7502a86652a54047a437793802bd18bb\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Using the Calendar by Keyboard</h1><div class=\"body taskbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">You can select dates with the keyboard.</p>\n<div class=\"section context\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Context</h2></div>\n<aside class=\"note\" aria-labelledby=\"n0t\"><div class=\"title\" id=\"n0t\"><strong>Note</strong></div>\n<p>The calendar control in the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Checkout</span> and\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Requisition</span> pages doesn’t support screen readers.</p></aside>\n<p class=\"p\">To use the calendar control with the keyboard:</p>\n</div>\n<section class=\"section procedure\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"ol steps tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Procedure</h2></div><ol class=\"ol steps\"><li class=\"li step\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Navigate to the calendar.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Control it using the following operations:</span>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table border=\"1\" frame=\"border\" rules=\"rows\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\" summary=\"\" class=\"simpletable choicetable choicetableborder\" id=\"loio7502a86652a54047a437793802bd18bb__choicetable_xms_pg3_3nb\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><thead><tr class=\"sthead chhead\"><th class=\"stentry choptionhd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d3692e53-option\">Operation</th><th class=\"stentry chdeschd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d3692e53-desc\">Instructions</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-option\" id=\"d3692e66\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Open calendar</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-desc d3692e66\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Press <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Enter</kbd>.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-option\" id=\"d3692e81\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Choose date</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-desc d3692e81\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Use the arrow up/down/left/right keys to navigate to the date area\nand press <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Enter</kbd> to choose a specific date.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-option\" id=\"d3692e96\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Switch from day to month</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-desc d3692e96\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Press <span class=\"ph keys keys\">\n<kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Ctrl</kbd>\n + <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Up</kbd>\n</span> (Windows) or <span class=\"ph keys keys\">\n<kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Ctrl</kbd>\n + <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Command</kbd>\n + <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Up</kbd>\n</span> (Mac) to switch from the day pane to the month pane, then press\n<kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Tab</kbd> and choose the month with the arrow\nup/down/left/right keys.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-option\" id=\"d3692e132\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Switch from month to year</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-desc d3692e132\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Press <span class=\"ph keys keys\">\n<kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Ctrl</kbd>\n + <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Up</kbd>\n</span> (Windows) or <span class=\"ph keys keys\">\n<kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Ctrl</kbd>\n + <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Command</kbd>\n + <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Up</kbd>\n</span> (Mac) to switch from the month pane to the year pane, then press\n<kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Tab</kbd> and choose the year with the arrow up/down/left/right\nkeys.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-option\" id=\"d3692e169\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Switch from year to month</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-desc d3692e169\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>In the year pane, choose the year and press <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Enter</kbd>; the\npane switches to the month pane, then press <span class=\"ph keys keys\">\n<kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Shift</kbd>\n + <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Tab</kbd>\n</span> and choose the month with the arrow up/down/left/right\nkeys.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-option\" id=\"d3692e193\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Switch from month to day</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d3692e53-desc d3692e193\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>In the month pane, choose the month and press <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Enter</kbd>; the\npane switches to the day pane, then press <span class=\"ph keys keys\">\n<kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Shift</kbd>\n + <kbd class=\"keyword key key\">Tab</kbd>\n</span> and choose the day with the arrow up/down/left/right\nkeys.</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div>\n</li></ol></section>\n</div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}